cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference ELENCHION in research or technical work, please cite this repository."
title: "ELENCHION: Evidence-Bounded Execution Intelligence Under Hostile Scrutiny"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Blackwood"
    given-names: "Julian Vance"

repository-code: "https://github.com/julianvanceblackwood/ELENCHION"
url: "https://github.com/julianvanceblackwood/ELENCHION"

abstract: >
  ELENCHION is an open research and engineering project investigating
  evidence-bounded execution intelligence: how defensible knowledge can
  be reconstructed from program execution when observation is incomplete,
  sensors have limits, clocks disagree, evidence conflicts, and evidence
  sources may become untrusted.

keywords:
  - execution intelligence
  - digital forensics
  - evidence provenance
  - uncertainty
  - security research
  - reproducibility
  - malware analysis
  - trust degradation
